    "detailed_description": "<strong>Climb the throne in Lands of Vodria</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">tactic</h2>Fight in tactical card battles against different opponents on a changing battlefield.<br>Sometimes even sacrificing some units to achieve victory can be helpful<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Strategy</h2>But wars are not only won in battles. Plan a long-term strategy to conquer the land.<br>Strengthen your army step by step and master the battlefield. Gather experience and use it wisely.<br>Whether you're spying on your opponent's cards or tweaking army upgrades, there are many ways to conquer Vodria.<br>Raid the cities for gold to improve yourself or conquer directly.<br>But stay alerted, your enemies will rally and throw you back.<br><br>Can you overcome them and take the throne?",
